<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">

<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>baskinrobbins</title>
	<th:block th:replace="fragments/header :: link"></th:block>
	<th:block th:replace="fragments/header :: script"></th:block>
</head>

<body>


	<th:block th:replace="fragments/header :: header"></th:block>
	<div id="carouselExample" class="carousel slide carousel-fade " data-bs-ride="carousel">
		<div class="carousel-inner">
			<div class="carousel-item active">
				<img src="./images/peko.png" class="d-block w-100" alt="...">
			</div>
			<div class="carousel-item">
				<img src="./images/greent.png" class="d-block w-100" alt="...">
			</div>
		</div>
		<button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExample" data-bs-slide="prev">
			<span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			<span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
		</button>
		<button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExample" data-bs-slide="next">
			<span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			<span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
		</button>
	</div>
	<hr>
	<div class="container">
		<h2>신상품</h2>
		<p>최근 등록한 상품 3건</p>
		<div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 row-cols-md-3 g-3">
			<div class="col">
				<div class="card shadow-sm">
					<svg class="bd-placeholder-img card-img-top" width="100%" height="225"
						xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Placeholder: Thumbnail"
						preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
						<title>Placeholder</title>
						<rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="#55595c"></rect><text x="50%" y="50%" fill="#eceeef"
							dy=".3em">Thumbnail</text>
					</svg>
					<div class="card-body">
						<p class="card-text">
						<ul>
							<li class="list-group-item" th:each="p : ${products}">
								<strong th:text="${p.name}"></strong>
							</li>
						</ul>
						</p>
						<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
							<div class="btn-group">
								<button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">View</button>
								<button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Edit</button>
							</div>
							<small class="text-body-secondary">9 mins</small>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="container">
		<h2>최근 게시글</h2>
		<p>자유 게시판(board)에서 최근 게시글 3건</p>
		<ul class="list-group mb-4">
			<li class="list-group-item" th:each="b : ${boards}">
				<strong th:text="${b.title}">제목</strong>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
	<div class="container">
		<h2>최근 질문</h2>
		<p>최근 질문 및 답변의 최근 질문만 3건</p>
	</div>
	<th:block th:replace="fragments/footer :: footer"></th:block>
</body>

</html>